{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2790","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2790","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2790\",\"parent_revision\":\"cec1db863644058c6569101f888e09d94a3428e9cb31390c3671b35ec4ebea98\",\"root_revision\":\"cec1db863644058c6569101f888e09d94a3428e9cb31390c3671b35ec4ebea98\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe `rich_markup_mode=None` kwarg (this repo's agent-only-CLI-output policy \u2014 no Rich markup in help text) is copy-pasted identically into 6 separate `typer.Typer()` constructions across `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/{artifacts,backlog,cli,cli_active_task,dispatch,sam_plan}.py` (artifacts.py:13, backlog.py:15, cli.py:54, cli_active_task.py:34, dispatch.py:24, sam_plan.py:60). Observed during dh-ponytail-review of the Rich-to-JSON CLI migration this session. Impact: no single source of truth for the policy \u2014 a future new sub-app is likely to forget the flag since it isn't centralized anywhere.\\n\\n**User-provided context**: reviewer's suggested fix is a shared `sub_app()` helper in `sam_schema/cli_output.py` that wraps `typer.Typer(rich_markup_mode=None, **kwargs)`, with each of the 6 files switching to `app = sub_app(...)`.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **duplicated rich_markup_mode=none kwarg across 6 typer.typer() constructions in sam_schema** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from dh-ponytail-review report, session 2026-08-05\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-05\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"3701f0fad205c54ee02db837957f71192205dff37e3b893ca1ff0270696e769f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABSdrS6A\"}"}